review_notes = "Strong medium/darker rough concrete option with restrained pitting and broad tonal variation. Useful as an older/rougher structural counterpart to the brighter concrete and formed concrete. Under Receiving lighting it becomes substantially darker, so room-level composition should avoid using it as the only dominant shell material where readability would suffer."
